# Keil MDK user-specific settings
*.uvguix.*
*.uvgui.*
*.uvgui

# Keil MDK build output
**/Objects/*
!**/Objects/*.hex
**/Listings/
*.o
*.obj
*.crf
*.d
*.dep
*.axf
*.elf
*.map
*.lst
*.lnp
